# Agent Skills Spec — Third-Party Notice

Reference specification for Skill package format profile.

- Source: https://agentskills.io/
- Version: <spec-version> (pinned in `../lock.json`)
- License: per the specification's own publishing page; referenced as a specification,
  not redistributed as executable code. See `../lock.json` for the pinned version.

This is a reference-only baseline (ADR-0002). Mora references the specification for
Skill package format; it does not bundle or redistribute the spec's source repository.
When a concrete Skill package is introduced in a later Phase, a separate ADR and
NOTICE file under this directory will be created for that package.
